{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/839514-what-s-the-sky-like-in-the-hedge","id":839514,"title":"What's the sky like in the hedge?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-29T16:30:13-08:00","id":839514,"title":"What's the sky like in the hedge?","content":"I've been wondering, what happens if a changeling manages to achieve some sort of flight inside the hedge? Bringing in an aircraft probably wouldn't be that good an idea, but using a contract to turn into a bird or making some kind of hedgespun flying machine might work. So what does the changeling see when they get up high? What's up there? Sky pirates? Floating islands? Flying whales?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:40:12-08:00","id":839526,"title":"","content":"The &quot;thorns&quot; would be winds, clouds, lightning and the like. The weather would be fickle and mad, as well as psychoactive. There are places of empty, peaceful air--the paths and trods. There aren't many Gates in or out up there, however. And there are goblin skypirates, flying whales, fog sharks, griffins, rocs, harpies, wind and weather elementals, island-hollows, and strange aerial flotsam and jetsam.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:46:04-08:00","id":839530,"title":"","content":"Above the brambles?<br /> <br /> There is a sky there, above the canopy of the forest. There's sun and moon and stars, and clouds and lightning and wind below that. There's summer rains and winter snows. It's, you know.<br /> <br /> A sky.<br /> <br /> In the distance, you might see the forest grow in pillars and spirals into the sky-labyrinth roads you'd have never noticed a turn in. These beanstalks of light surrealism, growing concrete and dry brambles reach into the heavens, caressing and scratching the stars.<br /> <br /> But, you know, it's mostly just a sky.<br /> <br /> Well. Just we say. It's never <i>just</i> a sky. It's <i>the </i>sky. It's everyone's sky. Not like those Arcadian skies, that belong to the Strangers. It's the sky from little rural community on the edge of the big city you came from, and it's the same sky that hangs over the goblin city where fates are gambled away in the night, and it's the same sky as your enemies neighborhood in the industrial slums of a city the world is trying to forget. Its, you know.<br /> <br /> Home. To everyone.<br /> <br /> One sky.<br /> <br /> One destiny.<br /> <br /> #DisneyIsSoGonnaSueMyAss","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:47:57-08:00","id":839532,"title":"","content":"...oh my god, BEANSTALKS! I completely forgot that one of the most famous fairy tales of all time is about climbing a beanstalk into the sky and reaching a kingdom in the clouds. Thank you for reminding me, I love it- cloud islands held up by thorny beanstalks like space elevators...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:53:48-08:00","id":839536,"title":"","content":"Note to self: never write about stuff in the Hedge Sky. It's too much of a metaphor for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:56:06-08:00","id":839537,"title":"","content":"Now we get to brass tacks- how do you stat a Hedgespun airship? How do you make one?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T16:59:45-08:00","id":839540,"title":"","content":"I'd make a place to launch, first. That's a lot of work, given the Hedge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-29T17:19:01-08:00","id":839550,"title":"","content":"Heh. I've been drawing a map of Buena Vista, and I've decided on a general theme for the city: The hubris of technology and the fantasies it failed to fulfill. The result is reflected in the local Hedge: Go high enough into the sky, and it's a fae parody of sci-fi space, with thorny asteroids and 'spacey' remixes of fantasy tropes. The Hedge portion of Port Atlantis actually functions as a space and sea port.<br /> <br /> ---<br /> <br /> Just remembered a dream I had: I was a mouse in a 1800's French city with a cat I was in a duel with. For some silly dream reason, the duel requires we go retrieve a (sentient?) red balloon that's left the city. When we bring it back, everything's white metal, video games, blacklights, and zeppelins. Cue flying a small propeller-driven airplane through heavy zeppelin traffic as we try to find our neighborhood underneath all the machinery.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}